### Prueba de publicacion  ML

### 1. Crear el producto
POST {{url}}/api/productos
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "COPA-VINO-4",
  "nombre": "Set 4 Copas De Vino Vidrio Transparente 350ml",
  "descripcion": "Set de 4 copas de vino de vidrio transparente",
  "precio": 9990,
  "categoriaId": 1,
  "stockInicial": 15
}

### 2. Atributos
GET {{url}}/api/mercadolibre/categorias/MLC457489/atributos?userId=3742351220
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Publicar en ML
POST {{url}}/api/productos/5/publicaciones
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 3742351220,
  "categoryId": "MLC457489",
  "pictures": [ "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1514651029128-173d2e6ea851?w=1200&fm=jpg" ],
  "atributos": [
    { "id": "BRAND", "valueName": "Genérica" },
    { "id": "MODEL", "valueName": "Copa vino 350ml" },
    { "id": "DRINKING_GLASS_PRODUCT_TYPE", "valueId": "6530860" },
    { "id": "SALE_FORMAT", "valueId": "1359392" },
    { "id": "UNITS_PER_PACK", "valueName": "4" },
    { "id": "EMPTY_GTIN_REASON", "valueId": "17055159" }
  ]
}

### 4. Revisar lo que quedo guardado
GET {{url}}/api/productos/{{crearCopas.response.body.$.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
